  <abstract format="text/plain" language="en" script="Latn">Recommendation ITU-T Y.3324 specifies the high-level and functional requirements and architecture of autonomic management and control (AMC) for IMT-2020 networks. It also specifies interworking reference points between AMC and IMT-2020 management and orchestration architecture, and legacy NMS/OSS. In Appendix I, it describes a use case to realize the AMC architecture through the ETSI GANA reference model.</abstract>
